flowchart TB
    REC[Redo loop replays<br/>XLOG_CHECKPOINT_SHUTDOWN<br/>or XLOG_CHECKPOINT_ONLINE] --> XR[xlog_redo<br/>xlog.c:8251]
    XR --> RRP[RecoveryRestartPoint<br/>xlog.c:7544]
    RRP --> CHECK{Enough advance<br/>since last restartpoint?}
    CHECK -->|no| SKIP[skip — too soon]
    CHECK -->|yes| FLAG[XLogCtl:<br/>lastCheckPoint=cp<br/>lastCheckPointRecPtr=lsn<br/>lastCheckPointIsRequired=true]
    FLAG --> CKPTR[Checkpointer process<br/>sees flag in main loop]
    CKPTR --> CRP[CreateRestartPoint<br/>xlog.c:7585]
    CRP -->|RecoveryInProgress check| RIP{In recovery?}
    RIP -->|no| ABORT[refuse]
    RIP -->|yes| LOCK[acquire CheckpointLock]
    LOCK --> CPG[CheckPointGuts<br/>cp.redo, flags]
    CPG --> CL[CheckPointCLOG]
    CPG --> CT[CheckPointCommitTs]
    CPG --> SS[CheckPointSUBTRANS]
    CPG --> MX[CheckPointMultiXact]
    CPG --> PR[CheckPointPredicate]
    CPG --> RM[CheckPointRelationMap]
    CPG --> SL[CheckPointReplicationSlots]
    CPG --> SB[CheckPointSnapBuild]
    CPG --> LR[CheckPointLogicalRewriteHeap]
    CPG --> CB[CheckPointBuffers<br/>flushes all dirty pages]
    CPG --> SR[ProcessSyncRequests<br/>fsync queued files]
    CPG --> TP[CheckPointTwoPhase]
    CL & CT & SS & MX & PR & RM & SL & SB & LR & CB & SR & TP --> UPD[Update pg_control]
    UPD --> MIN[minRecoveryPoint=<br/>max minRecoveryPoint, replayEndRecPtr;<br/>minRecoveryPointTLI=replayEndTLI]
    MIN --> WCF[UpdateControlFile<br/>fsync]
    WCF --> KSEG[KeepLogSeg]
    KSEG --> RMOLD[RemoveOldXlogFiles<br/>recycle pg_wal segments]
    RMOLD --> ACC{archive_cleanup_command<br/>set?}
    ACC -->|yes| ECC[ExecuteRecoveryCommand<br/>%r=last restartpoint segment]
    ACC -->|no| RELEASE
    ECC --> RELEASE[release CheckpointLock]
    RELEASE --> DONE[restartpoint complete]
